Section: libs
Priority: optional
Multi-Arch: same
Homepage: https://github.com/libkrun/libkrun
Description: Virtualization-based process isolation library
 libkrun lets a program run processes in a partially isolated environment
 using hardware virtualization: KVM on Linux, HVF on macOS and WHP on
 Windows. It embeds the userspace side of the hypervisor and the minimum set
 of virtio devices a container-like workload needs, and exposes a C API.
 .
 The guest kernel is loaded from libkrunfw at run time.
